  "title": "Perception is cosmic thought impinging on a dissociative boundary",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "8501b83f-404e-45f3-9d0e-df86fbf0bb29",
      "text": "Perception arises when thoughts of cosmic consciousness outside an alter impinge on its dissociative boundary. What we call the physical world is the alter’s experience of that interference.",
